<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>UiPath.GoogleVertex.IntegrationService.Activities</id>
    <version>5.1.2</version>
    <title>Google Vertex</title>
    <authors>UiPath</authors>
    <owners></owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://www.uipath.com/hubfs/legalspot/UiPath_MSSA.pdf</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://docs.uipath.com/activities/docs/uipath-google-vertex-about</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://download.uipath.com/UI_icon.png</iconUrl>
    <description>This package is deprecated as of Studio 23.10. 
Integration Service Connectors can now be used directly from the Project's Activities panel or Package Manager under All Connectors.

THIS VERSION REQUIRES THE AUTOMATION CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE. Vertex AI is a machine learning (ML) platform that lets you train and deploy ML models and AI applications, and customize large language models (LLMs) for use in your AI-powered applications. Vertex AI combines data engineering, data science, and ML engineering workflows, enabling your teams to collaborate using a common toolset and scale your applications using the benefits of Google Cloud.  This connector will give you access to Google Generative AI model, PaLM.</description>
    <copyright>© UiPath</copyright>
    <tags>UiPathActivities googlevertex,vertex,ai,integration,gpt,artificial intelligence,llm,large language model</tags>
